[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17106.15, "timestamp": "04:45:06", "text": "啊，終於自由了。自由。心跳。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17129.628, "timestamp": "04:45:29", "text": "哦，它跳動著。  好的，它有心跳。我的天啊。  繁榮。繁榮。繁榮。繁榮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17138.39, "timestamp": "04:45:38", "text": "好的，我這就找找。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17158.15, "timestamp": "04:45:58", "text": "[音樂] [音樂] [掌聲]"}]